        "slc_cee29964b57577c43bf818c59c77b7770a6a6a7aa442f154a3b7c000002cbc6e"
      ],
      "text": "Tools are defined by subclassing ToolMessage with a request field naming the handling agent method, a purpose description, and typed arguments; agents enable tools via enable_message, and Pydantic validation errors are sent back to the LLM for self-correction."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
      "claim_id": "clm_6ef3ce00978788541270b7a15de8d3f87b6d107643f1ed25178f001d2b6e9c23",
