      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_f58e8c78c60adf70baaba9bf2308ed0a9b27d49504c237f36317cad4caa500ea"
      ],
      "text": "TableChatAgent accepts a dataset (file path, URL, or dataframe) and answers queries by having its LLM generate Pandas code via function-calling, which the agent's handler method executes."
    },
    {
