      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_261a81012f9db01fd2ce5c58697aa0974f279f69b452391379eace243bd45d46"
      ],
      "text": "LLM API responses can be cached via Redis or Momento (CACHE_TYPE=momento); if Redis settings are absent, Langroid falls back to a pure-Python in-memory cache via Fakeredis."
    },
    {
      "basis": "documented",
