        "slc_0eb7d420f67621d99b23a67dea6e1671ab46970206e4de104bcacbc617bce45e"
      ],
      "text": "A Claude Code plugin provides two skills: langroid:patterns for generating Langroid multi-agent code using proper design patterns, and langroid:add-pattern for recording newly learned patterns for future reference."
    },
